# Route: guide 48 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to
# 60, 23 quests, 1.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Ashenvale, The Barrens, Blasted Lands, Swamp of Sorrows): Fallen Sky
# Lake -> The Zoram Strand -> The Shrine of Aessina -> Lake Falathim ->
# Astranaar -> Lake Falathim -> Mystral Lake -> Ratchet -> Nethergarde Keep ->
# Splinterspear Junction -> Misty Reed Strand -> Nethergarde Keep -> Dreadmaul
# Hold -> ….
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Blackfathom Villainy (1200), Mortality Wanes (1142),
# Willix the Importer (1144), Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Blueleaf Tubers (1221),
# Deviate Eradication (1487), Deviate Eradication (1487), The Glowing Shard
# (6981), Nekrum's Medallion (2991).

